{"strongs": "H4441", "word": "מַלְכִּיָּהוּ", "translit": "mal.kiy.yah", "root": "מלך", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "my king is Yah", "definition": "מַלְכִּיָּהוּ (only Jer 38:6 ), מַלְכִּיָּה proper name, masculine ( my king is Yah ; compare Gray Prop. N. 119 f., 146 and elsewhere ); — ᵐ5 Μελχ ( ε ) ια ( ς ). — 1. father of Pashhur Jer 21:1 ; Jer 38:1 , compare 1Chr 9:12 (priest), Neh 11:12 . 2. a prince Jer 38:6 . 3. priests: \\ \\ a. 1Chr 24:9 . \\ \\ b. Neh 12:42 . 4. one of the sealed Neh 10:4 perhaps also Neh 8:4 . 5. a Levite 1Chr 6:25 . 6. various men: \\ \\ a. Ezra 10:25 a. \\ \\ b. Ezra 10:25 b. \\ \\ c. Ezra 10:31 = Neh 3:11 . \\ \\ d. Neh 3:14 . \\ \\ e. Neh 3:31 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4683')\">BDB4683</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4441')\">H4441</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4682')\">BDB4682</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4684')\">BDB4684</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַלְכִּיָּהוּ</bdbheb> (only <ref ref=\"Jer 38:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,6)\">Jer 38:6</ref>), <bdbheb>מַלְכִּיָּה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>my king is Yah</highlight>; compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gray')\">Gray<sup>Prop. N. 119 f., 146 and elsewhere</sup></lookup>); — <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Μελχ</grk>(<grk>ε</grk>)<grk>ια</grk>(<grk>ς</grk>). — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> father of Pashhur <ref ref=\"Jer 21:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,1)\">Jer 21:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 38:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,1)\">Jer 38:1</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,12)\">1Chr 9:12</ref> (priest), <ref ref=\"Neh 11:12\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,12)\">Neh 11:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a prince <ref ref=\"Jer 38:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,6)\">Jer 38:6</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> priests: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,9)\">1Chr 24:9</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:42\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,42)\">Neh 12:42</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> one of the sealed <ref ref=\"Neh 10:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,4)\">Neh 10:4</ref> perhaps also <ref ref=\"Neh 8:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,4)\">Neh 8:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> a Levite <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:25\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,25)\">1Chr 6:25</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> various men: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:25\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,25)\">Ezra 10:25</ref> a. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:25\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,25)\">Ezra 10:25</ref> b. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:31\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,31)\">Ezra 10:31</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 3:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,11)\">Neh 3:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:14\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,14)\">Neh 3:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:31\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"31\" oncli